      "fieldtype": "HTML",
      "hidden": 1,
      "label": "terms",
      "options": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; color: #59BAE3; font-weight: 500;\"><em>If you have any questions concerning the proposed procedure/treatment, ask the doctor before signing this consent form. Read and thoroughly understand the written explanations of the procedure(s) (where applicable)</em></p> "
